  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지난 달 중순부터 지필고사가 끝난 3학년이 있는 학교로 와서 수업하고 있습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">전자기 실험을 단계별로 정리하여 실험하면서 틈틈이 다른 탐구 활동도 추가하고 있는데요.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">새로 만난 학생들과 타이포그래피도 해 보았습니다. 같은 주제를 두고 표현하는 방식이 &#39;다름&#39;이 흥미롭습니다. (학생 한 명당 한 작품)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">몇 가지 산출물을 소개합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42f7a20792d084b82ec76d09a2df776282b070c8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42f7a20792d084b82ec76d09a2df776282b070c8\" data-origin-width=\"1330\" data-origin-height=\"927\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f1f549c8df2219179f4a6bd21bf2ca207799b3e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f1f549c8df2219179f4a6bd21bf2ca207799b3e\" data-origin-width=\"1362\" data-origin-height=\"915\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b4c76f8b0a15aa622c0c9272e275a3068620be2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b4c76f8b0a15aa622c0c9272e275a3068620be2\" data-origin-width=\"1376\" data-origin-height=\"938\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e86290c9f11e11130d01b7f37ace88a119034e52\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e86290c9f11e11130d01b7f37ace88a119034e52\" data-origin-width=\"1345\" data-origin-height=\"893\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" da